{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/1032449-weaponizing-wastelands-and-firestorms","id":1032449,"title":"Weaponizing Wastelands and Firestorms?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Promethean: The Created"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-01-15T20:15:53-08:00","id":1032449,"title":"Weaponizing Wastelands and Firestorms?","content":"It occurred to me that the Bale Hounds of W:tF might see use to Wastelands, if one were willing to argue that a severe-enough Wasteland creates a Wound at a locus point. An Ulgan's Wasteland especially seems like it would wear the Gauntlet thin, though I don't imagine that the Beshilu would be cunning or well-versed enough to take advantage of that. Are there other supernatural creatures who'd be interested in turning the more difficult-to-control aspects of Prometheans toward their own ends, in the event they learned of those aspects by happenstance?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5236-lackey-man-ren","name":"Lackey Man Ren","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-15T22:43:44-08:00","id":1032490,"title":"","content":"The closest thing I've ever done to &quot;weaponizing&quot; either of those was deliberately initiating a massive Firestorm in the hopes of provoking an appearance by a Qashmal as a last resort to slow the roll of a rampaging True Fae. It worked, but it wasn't the kind of thing you can get away with doing every day.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/mem